<title>BELGIUM: EU states to review sugar storage levy stats.</title>
<headline>EU states to review sugar storage levy stats.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union member states will be asked to review sugar storage levy statistics at the weekly sugar management committee meeting on Wednesday, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;This is an annual review. Member states will be given EU statistics and asked to review them,&quot; the official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The committee agenda includes the usual weekly tenders and the setting of molasses import duties.</p>
</text>
